---
layout: index
permalink: /index.html
title: "Beep...Boop..."
blog:
  title: "Blog"
  intro: "Here are the 6 most recent posts. There's probably more though..."

---

<div class="wrapper">
  <header class="full | section" style="--spot-color: var(--color-primary)">
    <div class="section__inner flow region">
      <h1
        class="text-center"
        style="color: var(--color-bg);  font-size: var(--size-step-6) !important;"
      >
        {{ title }}
      </h1>
    </div>
    {% svg "divider/pixels", null, "divider" %}
  </header>

  <article class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow">
      <h2 id="an-eleventy-starter">I'm Kyle! (aka CybersecKyle)</h2>
      <p>
        I'm an IT professional working in the MSP/Cybersecurity industry. I love
        everything tech. You can check out more about me <a
          href="https://profile.kylereddoch.me"
        >here</a> or read my blog posts below. I blog about cybersecurity,
        technology trends, and best practices in IT. I even share the occasional
        tech review every now and then.
      </p>
      <!-- prettier-ignore -->
{% highlight "bash" %}
$ hostname
cyberseckyle.local

$ cat about-$(hostname).config
description="Cybersecurity analyst and MSP operator focused on securing modern infrastructure. Lover of all things tech and coffee."
focus_areas=["Endpoint Hardening", "Network Security", "Threat Intelligence", "Cloud Security"]
tech_stack=["PowerShell", "Python", "Linux", "SonicWall", "Kaseya", "EDR/XDR", "SIEM"]

$ diagnostics --run full
> Scanning system configs... [OK]
> Verifying patch compliance... [OK]
> Reviewing firewall rules... [WARN] minor gaps found
> Checking audit logs... [OK]
> Correlating threat intel... [OK]
> Report saved to /opt/kyle/intel/summary-{{ helpers.buildTimeFile() }}.log

$ buildtime
{{ helpers.buildTimeHuman() }}
{% endhighlight %}
    </div>
  </article>

  <section class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow">
      <h2>{{ blog.title }}</h2>
      {% if blog.intro %}
        <p>{{ blog.intro }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="feature | region region-space-l">
        <custom-masonry layout="50-50">
          {% set itemList = collections.allPosts %}
          {% asyncEach item in itemList.slice(0, 6) %}
          {% set headingLevel = "h3" %}
          {% include "partials/card-blog.njk" %}
          {% endeach %}
        </custom-masonry>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrapper flow mt-l-xl">
      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="/blog/" class="button" data-button-variant="primary"
        >View more posts</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
